      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### HISTORICAL PEAK TEMPERATURE · SELECTED TIME RANGE\nCPU/GPU peak cards show the highest temperature recorded during the selected Grafana period. The small source sensor label and large centered number update together; each background graph follows only the sensor that produced that historical peak."
      }
